</given-names></name><name><surname>Clark</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Infected cardiac myxoma: case report and literature review</article-title><source><italic>Medicine</italic></source><year>1998</year><volume>77</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>337</fpage><lpage>344</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9772922</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B16"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Luaces M&#x000e9;ndez</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Vilacosta</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Sarri&#x000e1;</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Endocarditis infecciosa y embolias del eje hepatoesplenorrenal</article-title><source><italic>Revista Espanola de Cardiologia</italic></source><year>2004</year><volume>57</volume><issue>12</issue><fpage>1188</fpage><lpage>1196</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15617642</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>16</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Riad</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name><name><surname>Parks</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></name><name><surname>Thangathurai</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Infected atrial myxoma presenting with septic shock</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Cardiothoracic and Vascular Anesthesia</italic></source><year>2005</year><volume>19</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>508</fpage><lpage>511</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16085260</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>17</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kuroczy&#x00144;ski</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Peivandi</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ewald</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Pruefer</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Heinemann</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Vahl</surname><given-names>C-F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cardiac myxomas: short- and long-term follow-up</article-title><source><italic>Cardiology Journal</italic></source><year>2009</year><volume>16</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>447</fpage><lpage>454</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19753524</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-group><fig id="fig1" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Transesophageal echocardiography revealing large heterogeneous density tumor in the left atrium.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRM2009-306375.001"/></fig></floats-group></article>